                                                "text": "With deep creases slanting across the jowls of his dark bony face from the corners of his wide full mouth, and his sunken dark eyes, he was certainly a prime subject for the artists who sketch candidates for the hot seat for the tabloids, and for three days they had been making the most of it."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5b78c44d-a77f-3d37-9c5c-8981c5a59176",
                                        "entry_id": "36234078-57b4-3120-b61e-101dc1df964b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The seat occupied by a game show contestant at a stage where they are answering questions alone."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3e95467d-0459-38bc-9a91-bed433c40ed6",
                                        "entry_id": "36234078-57b4-3120-b61e-101dc1df964b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any stressful situation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e3369856-2f5e-420d-ba5f-671fa9a96c4e",
                                                "sense_id": "3e95467d-0459-38bc-9a91-bed433c40ed6",
                                                "text": "Now just a minute. You turn up out of nowhere, a routine space shot goes wrong, a new planet appears and you tell us you know all about it. That puts you slap bang in the hot seat, right?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a1b4e422-6965-3586-bc60-1ff2c04ad2a3",
                                        "entry_id": "36234078-57b4-3120-b61e-101dc1df964b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A multiplayer game mode where the players take turns playing the game."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "attributive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "186d580a-df9a-42c2-97bc-5c95d7eb677f",
                                                "sense_id": "a1b4e422-6965-3586-bc60-1ff2c04ad2a3",
                                                "text": "In addition to traditional LAN play and online modes, there's […] a hot seat mode in which multiple players take their turns on the same computer […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
